  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JEEP Solar Cold Storage and Lighting Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Solar Summary: Joint Energy and Environment Projects is a women-owned and run Ugandan company. JEEP plans to establish six solar cold storage and lighting centers on two islands in Kalangala District, Uganda, one in Kyamuswa Sub Country and the other in Bubeke Sub County.</narrative>
